  "label": "Police Officer as Authority Figure: Represents law enforcement and order",
  "description": "The image of a police officer, especially a female one, is used to symbolize authority, law enforcement, and order. In this meme, the officer is portrayed as a figure of retaliation, suggesting that the state or its agents are being called upon to respond to a perceived threat. This ties into broader cultural narratives about police as protectors or enforcers of societal norms.",
